  "display_title": "Wind Beneath My Wings - Extended",
  "description": "The final season of \"Wind Beneath My Wings\" follows Seo-Ha, once a servant of the divine windborn, now reincarnated as a human after being cast out of the heavens. His former master, Shane, descends to the mortal world to reclaim him. As they grow closer living side by side, their bond is shaken when Shane discovers Chang-Hee, a man from Seo-Ha’s past. Meanwhile, unrest stirs in the heavens, and with the windborn calling him back, Shane must decide: return to his divine duty, or stay with the one he's come to love.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
